   chapters stand side by side under the h2, each photograph over its title and lines; a phone stacks
   them. The section is then as tall as its chapters, one screen at least, at every width: a held
   section's extra screens would stand empty. Live (.is-live, moment.js) the section is (hold + 1)
   screens and its box sticks for the hold: the h2 and lead at the top, one stage of photographs the
